webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795800/extras/83c4a3c8b75e628c71e99a9246caa3ed.mp4?t=1770972603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795800/extras/32de1cbda5b67792517d01eaf80a2701.poster.avif?t=1770972603\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795800/extras/32de1cbda5b67792517d01eaf80a2701.webm?t=1770972603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person psychological horror experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story begins with vehicle exploration and unfolds gradually</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paranormal investigation and atmosphere-driven gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental puzzles and immersive exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal UI for total immersion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Headphones strongly recommended</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795800/extras/29e5cfde7788937a8710f02ab6481900.poster.avif?t=1770972603\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795800/extras/29e5cfde7788937a8710f02ab6481900.webm?t=1770972603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Details:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>9 languages</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 stages</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- trip to the motel stage (prolog)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- motel stage with a lot of rooms</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- labyrinth nightmare stage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- run nightmare stage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- ending stage (epilog)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5+ type of enemies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- zombies </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- deamon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- spiders<br>- creepy creatures</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20+ rooms, like</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- gravity room with platformer elements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- water room with enemies, platformer elements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- frozen rooms with puzzle, enemies, platformer elements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- fire room with enemy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- music room with puzzle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- code room with puzzle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- mirror system room with puzzle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and others..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What you can do in this game:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- platformer elements (sprint, jump, etc)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- collectibles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- throwables</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- inspectables</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- readables</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- interactable items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- computer interaction</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- auto checkpoints at some points</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- achivements</p>",
